    "character": "Kai",
    "src": "/sprites/kai_neutral.svg",
    "position": "left",
    "next": "narration_1"
  },
  {
    "id": "narration_1",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "character": null,
    "text": "After the last bell, the hallway emptied — except for the two of them.",
    "next": "kai_1"
  },
  {
    "id": "kai_1",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "character": "Kai",
    "text": "You're still here? I thought you had club after school.",
    "next": "aria_1"
  },
  {
    "id": "aria_1",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "character": "Aria",
    "text": "It got cancelled. Advisor was sick.",
    "next": "kai_2"
  },
  {
    "id": "kai_2",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "character": "Kai",
    "text": "Huh. So you've just been wandering around?",
    "next": "aria_2"
  },
  {
    "id": "aria_2",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "character": "Aria",
    "text": "Maybe. Is that a problem?",
    "next": "kai_3"
  },
  {
    "id": "kai_3",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "character": "Kai",
    "text": "Not at all. I was just thinking — there's a café near the station. Haven't been in a while.",
    "next": "aria_3"
  },
  {
    "id": "aria_3",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "character": "Aria",
    "text": "Is that an invitation?",
    "next": "kai_4"
  },
  {
    "id": "kai_4",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "character": "Kai",
    "text": "... Take it however you want.",
    "next": "choice_1"
  },
  {
    "id": "choice_1",
    "type": "choice",
    "choices": [
      { "label": "\"I'd love to.\"", "goto": "accept_1" },
      { "label": "\"Maybe another time.\"", "goto": "decline_1" }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "accept_1",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "character": "Aria",
    "text": "Sure. Lead the way, then.",
    "next": "kai_accept"
  },
  {
    "id": "kai_accept",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "character": "Kai",
    "text": "... You didn't have to agree so fast.",
    "next": "aria_accept"
  },
  {
    "id": "aria_accept",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "character": "Aria",
    "text": "Would you have preferred I made you wait?",
    "next": "narration_good"
  },
  {
    "id": "narration_good",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "character": null,
    "text": "He didn't answer. But as they walked out together, something about the afternoon felt lighter.",
    "next": "end"
  },
  {
    "id": "decline_1",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "character": "Aria",
    "text": "... Maybe another time.",
    "next": "kai_decline"
  },
  {
    "id": "kai_decline",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "character": "Kai",
    "text": "Right. Sure.",
    "next": "narration_neutral"
  },
  {
    "id": "narration_neutral",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "character": null,
    "text": "He turned and walked away first. She watched him go, wondering if she'd said the wrong thing.",
    "next": "end"
  },
  {
    "id": "end",
    "type": "end"
  }
]
